From: Dallas Delaney <dadelan@microsoft.com>
Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 22:57:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] tests: cover critical signed EROFS regressions

Keep only the mandatory compatibility updates and focused regression coverage for fatal oversized referrers, SELinux fsconfig unquoting with valid legacy mount data, snapshot removal cleanup using the persisted snapshot ID, verified fsview fallback, and two-phase dm-verity referrer selection.

Construct the metadata-only cleanup checks in block mode so package tests do
not depend on host EROFS kernel support.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>

